flag provided but not defined: -idea
Usage of run:
  -auto
    	auto-drive the protocol past round-01 (default; use --no-auto to disable) (default true)
  -dir string
    	workspace directory (default ".")
  -max-driver-steps int
    	auto-drive loop ceiling: max progress steps before escalating (explicit 0 = unlimited; omit to use ~/.parley [defaults.loop])
  -max-wall-clock duration
    	auto-drive loop ceiling: total wall-clock budget before escalating, e.g. 90m (explicit 0 = unlimited; omit to use ~/.parley [defaults.loop])
  -no-auto
    	disable auto-drive: stop after round-01 and advance the protocol manually
  -no-implement
    	stop the auto-driver at FINAL.md (skip code-writing implementation/fix-up phases)
  -no-ping
    	preflight presence-only: skip the hosted-PONG roster ping (faster; for CI)
  -no-preflight
    	skip the pre-idea readiness check (CI escape)
  -no-tui
    	run without opening the TUI after the round
  -participants string
    	comma-separated agent IDs to run
  -preset parley preset list
    	named roster preset to expand into participants (see parley preset list)
  -quota-auto-exclude value
    	new idea quota exclusion policy (true or false)
  -track string
    	conditional-rigor track: fast|standard|deliberation (also drives track-linked roster defaults)
  -yes
    	launch selected agents without interactive confirmation
